{"id": "viva_pulse.composites.circuits.pulse_whole_body_circuits", "name": "pulse_whole_body_circuits", "description": "Every circuit module on one real whole-body Pulse engine: cardiovascular (with renal and tissue branches), respiratory, mechanical ventilator, thermal and supplemental oxygen, so effects that cross circuits appear in one run. All setpoints start at their baselines; the ventilator and oxygen start disconnected, and only one of them can be connected at a time.", "parameters": {"model_type": {"type": "string", "default": "whole_body", "choices": ["whole_body"], "description": "Pulse engine running the circuits"}, "state_file": {"type": "string", "default": "StandardMale@0s.json", "description": "Stabilized Pulse patient state in <install>/bin/states (whole_body only; set this or patient_file, not both)"}, "patient_file": {"type": "string", "default": "StandardMale.json", "description": "Patient in <install>/bin/patients (on whole_body, also a path). ventilation_mechanics starts from it; on whole_body it replaces state_file, stabilized once (about 13 s) and then cached"}, "circuit_modifiers": {"type": "map", "default": {}, "description": "Circuit path or node name -> multiplier on the resistance, compliance or volume Pulse initializes it with (whole_body only). The patient is stabilized with them (about 25 s the first time, then cached), so the rest of the body adapts: a different patient, not a perturbation"}, "circuit_additions": {"type": "map", "default": {}, "description": "New path name -> {source, target, resistance_mmHg_s_per_mL}: a resistance path between two FullCardiovascular nodes in different compartments, added with its compartment link so substances follow (whole_body only). A perturbation: the body responds over time"}, "interval": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Seconds per update; 0.02 (Pulse's timestep) resolves per-beat/per-breath waveforms. A non-binary-exact interval can lose the final update of a run to float time accumulation."}, "point_reads": {"type": "boolean", "default": false, "description": "Also read every node and path of the circuit drawing (whole_body only), under circuits/<circuit>_points/"}, "arterial_compliance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular arterial compliance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "arterial_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular arterial resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "pulmonary_compliance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular pulmonary compliance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "pulmonary_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular pulmonary resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "systemic_compliance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular systemic compliance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "systemic_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular systemic resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "venous_compliance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular venous compliance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "venous_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular venous resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "heart_rate_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular heart rate multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "stroke_volume_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse cardiovascular stroke volume multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "hemorrhage_compartment": {"type": "string", "default": "RightLeg", "choices": ["Aorta", "Brain", "Muscle", "LargeIntestine", "LeftArm", "LeftKidney", "LeftLeg", "Liver", "RightArm", "RightKidney", "RightLeg", "Skin", "SmallIntestine", "Splanchnic", "Spleen", "VenaCava"], "description": "Hemorrhage site"}, "hemorrhage_severity": {"type": "float", "default": 0.0, "description": "Hemorrhage severity in [0, 1]; 0 = no bleed"}, "left_compliance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory left compliance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "right_compliance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory right compliance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "left_inspiratory_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory left inspiratory resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "left_expiratory_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory left expiratory resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "right_inspiratory_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory right inspiratory resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "right_expiratory_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory right expiratory resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "upper_inspiratory_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory upper inspiratory resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "upper_expiratory_resistance_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory upper expiratory resistance multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "respiration_rate_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory respiration rate multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "tidal_volume_multiplier": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Pulse respiratory tidal volume multiplier (1.0 = unmodified)"}, "intubation_type": {"type": "string", "default": "Tracheal", "choices": ["Tracheal", "Esophageal", "LeftMainstem", "RightMainstem", "Oropharyngeal", "Nasopharyngeal"], "description": "Tube placement used when intubated = 1"}, "intubated": {"type": "float", "default": 0.0, "description": "1 = intubated, 0 = not"}, "ventilator_mode": {"type": "string", "default": "AssistedControl", "choices": ["AssistedControl", "ContinuousMandatoryVentilation"], "description": "Pressure-control mode"}, "connected": {"type": "float", "default": 0.0, "description": "Ventilator connected"}, "inspiratory_pressure_cmH2O": {"type": "float", "default": 19.0, "description": "Ventilator inspiratory pressure cmH2O"}, "peep_cmH2O": {"type": "float", "default": 5.0, "description": "Ventilator peep cmH2O"}, "respiration_rate_bpm": {"type": "float", "default": 12.0, "description": "Ventilator respiration rate bpm"}, "inspiratory_period_s": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Ventilator inspiratory period s"}, "slope_s": {"type": "float", "default": 0.2, "description": "Ventilator slope s"}, "fraction_inspired_oxygen": {"type": "float", "default": 0.21, "description": "Ventilator fraction inspired oxygen"}, "ambient_temperature_C": {"type": "float", "default": 22.0, "description": "Air temperature around the body (not the air breathed; see respiration_ambient_temperature_C)"}, "mean_radiant_temperature_C": {"type": "float", "default": 22.0, "description": "Mean radiant temperature of the surroundings"}, "respiration_ambient_temperature_C": {"type": "float", "default": 22.0, "description": "Temperature of the air breathed; drives respiration heat loss"}, "relative_humidity": {"type": "float", "default": 0.6, "description": "Relative humidity in [0, 1]"}, "air_velocity_m_per_s": {"type": "float", "default": 0.1, "description": "Air speed over the body"}, "clothing_resistance_clo": {"type": "float", "default": 0.5, "description": "Clothing thermal resistance (1 clo = 0.155 m^2 K/W)"}, "active_heating_W": {"type": "float", "default": 0.0, "description": "Active heating power; Pulse delivers power x area fraction"}, "active_heating_area_fraction": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Fraction of skin area under active heating, in (0, 1]"}, "active_cooling_W": {"type": "float", "default": 0.0, "description": "Active cooling power; Pulse removes power x area fraction"}, "active_cooling_area_fraction": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Fraction of skin area under active cooling, in (0, 1]"}, "applied_temperature_on": {"type": "float", "default": 0.0, "description": "1 = apply applied_temperature_C over the clothing, 0 = off"}, "applied_temperature_C": {"type": "float", "default": 22.0, "description": "Applied temperature, used when applied_temperature_on = 1"}, "applied_temperature_area_fraction": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Fraction in (0, 1] by which Pulse blends the applied temperature with the ambient temperature"}, "oxygen_device": {"type": "string", "default": "NasalCannula", "choices": ["NasalCannula", "SimpleMask", "NonRebreatherMask"], "description": "Supplemental oxygen device used when oxygen_connected = 1"}, "oxygen_connected": {"type": "float", "default": 0.0, "description": "1 = oxygen device on, 0 = off"}, "oxygen_flow_L_per_min": {"type": "float", "default": 3.5, "description": "Oxygen flow from a wall supply (Pulse's device defaults: nasal cannula 3.5, simple mask 7.5, non-rebreather 10)"}}, "state": {"pulse": {"_type": "process", "address": "local:PulseCircuitProcess", "config": {"model_type": "whole_body", "modules": ["cardiovascular", "respiratory", "mechanical_ventilator", "thermal", "supplemental_oxygen"], "state_file": "StandardMale@0s.json", "patient_file": "StandardMale.json", "circuit_modifiers": {}, "circuit_additions": {}, "hemorrhage_compartment": "RightLeg", "intubation_type": "Tracheal", "ventilator_mode": "AssistedControl", "oxygen_device": "NasalCannula"}, "interval": 1.0, "inputs": {"setpoints": ["interventions"]}, "outputs": {"cardiovascular": ["circuits", "cardiovascular"], "respiratory": ["circuits", "respiratory"], "mechanical_ventilator": ["circuits", "mechanical_ventilator"], "thermal": ["circuits", "thermal"], "supplemental_oxygen": ["circuits", "supplemental_oxygen"], "irreversible_state": ["circuits", "irreversible_state"]}, "doc": "Bridge to one real Pulse engine, exposing the selected circuit modules.\n\n``config.modules`` names entries of ``viva_pulse.circuits.MODULES``. Each\nmodule contributes a port subtree named after it:\n\n- outputs: the module's Pulse data requests as ``float`` ports, at the\n  module's nested paths (e.g. ``cardiovascular/central/aorta/pressure_mmHg``);\n- inputs, under the single ``setpoints`` port: the module's setpoints as\n  ``overwrite[float]`` ports whose schema default is the baseline value,\n  forwarded to Pulse as actions only on change (e.g.\n  ``setpoints/cardiovascular/hemorrhage_severity``).\n\nInputs and outputs use disjoint top-level port names on purpose:\nprocess-bigraph projects ``initial_state()`` through the input wires as\nwell as the output wires, so a shared name would copy readings into the\nsetpoint store.\n\nOutputs follow ``PulseProcess``'s contract. ``initial_state()`` seeds each\nstore with the loaded state's reading and every update emits\n``current - previous``, so the store always equals Pulse's own value.\n``irreversible_state`` turns True once Pulse reports an irreversible state;\nthe engine is not advanced after that. Identical requests from different\nmodules share one Pulse request. A request that Pulse cannot serve (it\nreturns NaN) raises at load or at the update where it appears, naming the\nrequest. A module's ``check_loaded`` sees its readings at load and can reject\na state that contradicts its setpoint baselines. All changed setpoint groups\nare validated before any action is sent, as is the airway rule: at most one\nmodule's ``airway_device`` connected, and none connecting in the update in\nwhich another disconnects.\n\nWholeBody loads a stabilized ``state_file``, or, when ``patient_file`` is\nset instead, that patient's state, stabilized once and then cached (see\n``viva_pulse.patients``); setting both raises. ``circuit_modifiers`` (circuit\npath or node name -> multiplier) stabilizes the patient with Pulse's\nconfiguration Modifiers, also cached; whole_body only. VentilationMechanics has no\nstate files, so it initializes from ``patient_file`` and then settles (see\n``_settle``) before t = 0; setting ``state_file`` on it raises, instead of\nbeing silently ignored.\nSetpoints, including connecting a ventilator, apply from the first update,\nso row 0 always shows the engine as loaded or settled.\n\nA module with ``prepare_state`` (the ``*_points`` modules) makes construction\nread and edit ``state_file``, so such a process needs the Pulse install when it\nis built, not only at its first update.", "interval_label": "1 s", "_contract": {"summary": "type(object) -> the object's type", "description": "type(name, bases, dict, **kwds) -> a new type", "inputs": {}, "outputs": {}, "config": {}, "math": [], "symbols": {}, "assumptions": [], "references": [], "face": {"inputs": {}, "outputs": {}}, "amendments": []}, "_inputs": {"setpoints": {"cardiovascular": {"arterial_compliance_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "arterial_resistance_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "pulmonary_compliance_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "pulmonary_resistance_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "systemic_compliance_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "systemic_resistance_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "venous_compliance_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "venous_resistance_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "heart_rate_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "stroke_volume_multiplier": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 1.0}, "hemorrhage_severity": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_default": 0.0}}, "respiratory": 